## CLI-OUT-09 |  | {'id': 'CLI-OUT-09', 'criterion': "`completions <shell>` and `schema` exit 0 without printing an error or panicking when stdout's reading end is already closed (e.g. piped into a command that exits early); a `--format json` report command's write error in that same situation propagates as `E213` and exits 1."}
## CLI-STATUS-01 |  | {'id': 'CLI-STATUS-01', 'criterion': '`callisto status`, with or without a callisto.toml, prints one row per package with its name, current version and planned bump (or `none`), then `<N> package(s) pending`, then a `Diagnostics:` section when any exist.'}
